          "text": "Before you begin"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/18596283143707-How-to-add-a-dynamic-image-to-a-push-notification#h_01H9RBJD85BA3943X1GGN67BKK",
          "text": "Add a dynamic image to a push notification"
